        "question": "Do I need an architect licensed specifically in {state}?",
        "answer": "Yes. A permit-ready drawing set must be stamped by an architect licensed in the state where the project is built. Every match you receive is verified as licensed in {state} before it reaches you."
      },
      {
        "scope": "cities",
        "group": "city",
        "sort": 1,
        "question": "How much does an architect cost in {city}?",
        "answer": "It depends on scope. A backyard ADU set typically starts around $3,900, a home addition around $11,000, and a new custom home from $26,000. You get an itemized instant estimate before talking to anyone, and each architect confirms a fixed quote or hourly rate on your scoping call."
      },
      {
        "scope": "cities",
        "group": "city",
        "sort": 2,
        "question": "Can this really be done remotely?",
        "answer": "Yes. Site information, measurements, and photos are collected digitally, and {city} plan-check submittals are handled electronically. You work with your architect over chat and video, and you hire and pay them directly, by milestone."
      },
